##
    How Books phrases things, which is nobody else's business.

    No visibility is written, so this reaches its own project and stops there. Library references
    Books and still cannot name Wording — which is the point. Books can change how it phrases a
    book, or delete this model outright, without breaking anyone, because nobody outside could
    have depended on it.

    Book is public for the opposite reason: Library is meant to use it, so it says so.
##

model Wording

    public global string function Join(string title, string author)
        yield title + " by " + author;
    end function

end model
